OL,3,GNEWSAReview calls for shared leadership
OL,4,Aacross health services                 
OL,6,FA series of changes to the way the Isle
OL,7,Fof Man's health system is run, aimed at
OL,8,Freducing duplication and simplifying   
OL,9,Faccountability, have been proposed in a
OL,10,Fnew report.                            
OL,12,FThe Department of Health and Social    
OL,13,FCare (DHSC), which is responsible for  
OL,14,Fhealth policy, budgets and oversight,  
OL,15,Fset out its progress in its latest     
OL,16,Fupdate.                                
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
