OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 447 Thu 26 NovC20:55/53
OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k     
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReview calls for shared leadership
OL,4,Aacross health services                 
OL,6,FAmong the proposals are plans for a    
OL,7,Fmore focused board for Manx Care, the  
OL,8,Fisland's national healthcare provider, 
OL,9,Falongside shared senior leadership and 
OL,10,Fa reduction in strategic priorities    
OL,11,Ffrom nine to five.                     
OL,13,FThe DHSC said the recommendations would
OL,14,Fbe brought before Tynwald in December  
OL,15,Fto provide "a clear account of         
OL,16,Fachievement since July and a considered
OL,17,Fbasis for the next decisions".         
